<title>USA: TABLE - Transtar Holdings LP Q2 net increases.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Transtar Holdings LP Q2 net increases.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Second quarter</p>
<p>					    1997		    1996</p>
<p> Operating revenues	     $ 142,550	     $135,219</p>
<p> Net income			    20,865		 18,988</p>
<p>						 First Six Months</p>
<p>					    1997		   1996</p>
<p> Operating revenues	     $ 238,631	     $230,986</p>
<p> Net income			    22,629		 19,643</p>
<p>					     (dollars in thousands)</p>
<p>NOTE:  The company said its operating expense in the second quarter of 1997 increased from the increased materials expenditures for repairs to freight cars, locomotives and track structure, recognition of expenses associated with a limited early retirement program during June 1997 and a reduction to cost in the second quarter of 1996 resulting from the settlement of environmental litigation, however, the company was not immediately available to comment on the figures for these expenses.</p>
